---@class gcp.bigtableadmin_v2.PatchProjectsInstancesTablesRequest
---@field clusterStates? gcp.bigtableadmin_v2.ClusterStateMap Output only. Map from cluster ID to per-cluster table state. If it could not be determined whether or not the table has data in a particular cluster (for example, if its zone is unavailable), then there will be an entry for the cluster with UNKNOWN `replication_status`. Views: `REPLICATION_VIEW`, `ENCRYPTION_VIEW`, `FULL`
